### GET valid rectangle
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rectangles/summary?base=4&height=6
Accept: application/json

### POST square
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rectangles/summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "base": 5,
  "height": 5
}

### GET invalid dimensions
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rectangles/summary?base=0&height=7
Accept: application/json

### POST invalid body
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rectangles/summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "base": -2,
  "height": 4
}
